# composer.lock IS committed on purpose.
# Composer ignores a dependency's lock file, so this costs consumers nothing — but without
# it CI resolves the newest matching dev tools on every run, and a patch release of Pint,
# PHPStan or Rector turns main red with no change to our code. Upgrades now arrive as
# Dependabot PRs where the new violations show up in review instead.

# Stray Windows redirect artefact
/nul

# Local AI assistant instructions — intentionally not published
CLAUDE.md
/.rector.cache/
